<%- include("partials/header"); -%> 

<div class="">
<section id="Main" style="background-color: #000000;">
   <div class="container-fluid p-0">
   <div class="full-screen-size">
    <div class="row" style="padding-top: 8rem;">
      <div class="col-lg-6 p-0">
       <div class="card card-main text-white bg-transparent border-0 rounded-0">
         <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1610333840478-a4a8819ce1d4?ixlib=rb-1.2.1&ixid=MnwxMjA3fDB8MHxwaG90by1wYWdlfHx8fGVufDB8fHx8&auto=format&fit=crop&w=870&q=80" class="card-img liquify svg-img" alt="...">
         <svg style="height: 0; opacity: 0; visibility: hidden;">
  <filter id="liquify">
      <feTurbulence baseFrequency="0.015" numOctaves="1" result="warp" type="fractalNoise"></feTurbulence>
      <feDisplacementMap id="liquid" in="SourceGraphic" in2="warp" scale="300" xChannelSelector="R" yChannelSelector="B"></feDisplacementMap>
    </filter>
</svg>
         <div class="card-img-overlay rounded-0 d-flex flex-column justify-content-center align-items-center">
           <h1 class="card-title">Vision</h1>
           <p class="card-text card-font">
            Dubai has established itself as a global tourism hub with visitors from all over the world and our long-term vision is to continue to build, create and design new concepts and events which target the electric mix of tourists as well as residents of the country. Premium Events Management creativity has no depth, our vision is limitless.
           </p>
         </div>
       </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-lg-6 p-0">
       <div class="card card-main text-white bg-transparent border-0 rounded-0">
         <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608433348878-e43dea08b910?ixlib=rb-1.2.1&ixid=MnwxMjA3fDB8MHxwaG90by1wYWdlfHx8fGVufDB8fHx8&auto=format&fit=crop&w=871&q=80" class="card-img liquify svg-img" alt="...">
         <svg style="height: 0; opacity: 0; visibility: hidden;">
  <filter id="liquify">
      <feTurbulence baseFrequency="0.015" numOctaves="1" result="warp" type="fractalNoise"></feTurbulence>
      <feDisplacementMap id="liquid" in="SourceGraphic" in2="warp" scale="300" xChannelSelector="R" yChannelSelector="B"></feDisplacementMap>
    </filter>
</svg>
         <div class="card-img-overlay rounded-0 d-flex flex-column justify-content-center align-items-center">
           <h1 class="card-title">Culture</h1>
           <p class="card-text card-font">
            Creativity is our Culture; we only build and create concepts and events that we truly believe in. These are born out of real passion, enthusiasm and determination. With our wealth of experience and relentless execution, we believe these factors will change the expectations and experiences within the Hospitality and Nightlife Industry.
           </p>
         </div>
       </div>
      </div>
    </div>
   </div>
   </div>
